{"id":63403,"mal_id":63403,"title":"Yani Neko","englishTitle":"Chainsmoker Cat","title_english":"Chainsmoker Cat","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"Chainsmoker Cat","ja":"ヤニねこ"},"synopsis":"The life of a catgirl named Yaniko \"Yani Neko\" Satou revolves solely around one thing: cigarettes. Due to her severe smoking addiction that causes extreme withdrawal symptoms, she struggles to lead a normal life. Even worse, she lives in a run-down apartment, is constantly low on funds, and even the most basic daily activities are a hurdle for her. Although her best attempts to stop smoking have not worked despite the many interventions from the people close to her, Yani Neko swears to quit one day—but her ambitious goal seems to drift further out of reach with every cigarette.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"La vida de una chica gato llamada Yaniko \"Yani Neko\" Satou gira únicamente en torno a una cosa: los cigarrillos. Debido a su grave adicción al tabaco que le provoca síntomas de abstinencia extremos, le cuesta llevar una vida normal. Peor aún, vive en un apartamento deteriorado, constantemente tiene pocos fondos e incluso las actividades diarias más básicas son un obstáculo para ella. Aunque sus mejores intentos por dejar de fumar no han funcionado a pesar de las numerosas intervenciones de las personas cercanas a ella, Yani Neko jura dejar de fumar algún día, pero su ambicioso objetivo parece alejarse más de su alcance con cada cigarrillo.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1420,"average_episode_duration":1420,"startDate":"2026-07-03","start_date":"2026-07-03","endDate":"2026-09-25","end_date":"2026-09-25","season":"summer","year":2026,"start_season":{"year":2026,"season":"summer"},"episodes":12,"num_episodes":12,"score":7.5,"mean":7.5,"numListUsers":166855,"num_list_users":166855,"genres":[{"id":50,"name":"Adult Cast"},{"id":51,"name":"Anthropomorphic"},{"id":4,"name"